/*
  Localizable.strings (French)
  CommandH

  Keys are the English source strings. SwiftUI literals (Text, Button, ...)
  and String(localized:) look them up in Bundle.main. %@ is a string argument.

  Do not translate: CommandH, Matt Senter, Senternet, Senternet LLC, other app
  names (Weatherling, Burly, Comoji, Premail, Highwire, StockCar, Orgabot,
  BeeReady, SeedMatrix), Slack, :emoji:, Cmd+H, Cmd+Tab, or keyboard glyphs
  such as ⌘. Never use an em dash in a translation.

  When a string names a macOS feature or place (Dock, menu bar, Show Desktop,
  Applications folder, login), use Apple's official localized name for it.

  The Hiding pane, the sidebar, the window title and the menu bar menu appear
  in the App Store screenshots: never add the words Mac or macOS to them.

  Every key here must exist in every other .lproj, and every string the app
  shows must be a key here: scripts/check-localization.py enforces both.
*/

/* ===== Menus and window title (main.swift) ===== */

/* Settings window title. */
"CommandH Preferences" = "Réglages de CommandH";

/* Menu item that opens the settings window (app menu and menu bar menu). */
"Preferences…" = "Réglages…";

/* App menu item (Cmd+H). */
"Hide CommandH" = "Masquer CommandH";

/* App menu item (Cmd+W). */
"Close Window" = "Fermer la fenêtre";

/* App menu item on Cmd+Q: closes the window but CommandH keeps running. */
"Close and Keep Running" = "Fermer sans quitter";

/* Menu item and settings button that really quits the app. */
"Quit CommandH" = "Quitter CommandH";

/* Menu bar menu checkbox and settings switch that turns CommandH on or off. */
"Enabled" = "Activé";

/* Menu bar submenu title for choosing how the last app is handled. */
"When Cmd+H Can't Hide" = "Quand Cmd+H ne peut pas masquer";

/* Menu bar submenu choice: hide the last app; CommandH briefly shows a Dock icon. */
"Hide the App (Dock icon appears)" = "Masquer l’app (icône dans le Dock)";

/* Menu bar submenu choice: use the system's Show Desktop instead. Show Desktop is the macOS feature name; use its official localized name. */
"Show Desktop (no Dock icon)" = "Afficher le bureau (sans icône dans le Dock)";

/* Menu bar menu checkbox that shows or hides the menu bar icon. Title case, like the other menu items. */
"Show in Menu Bar" = "Afficher dans la barre des menus";

/* Menu bar menu checkbox that starts CommandH at login. Title case, like the other menu items. */
"Open at Login" = "Ouvrir avec la session";

/* ===== Settings sidebar (SettingsView.swift) ===== */

/* Settings sidebar tab and pane title. */
"Hiding" = "Masquage";

/* Settings sidebar tab and pane title. Also the label of the system version row in About. */
"System" = "Système";

/* Settings sidebar tab and pane title. */
"Privacy" = "Confidentialité";

/* Settings sidebar tab and pane title listing the developer's other apps. */
"Other Projects" = "Autres projets";

/* Settings sidebar tab and pane title. */
"About" = "À propos";

/* Credit line in the sidebar and About. %@ is the developer's name, Matt Senter, which links to his site; place it where the language needs it. */
"Built by %@" = "Créé par %@";

/* Copyright line in the sidebar. %@ is the company name, Senternet LLC, which links to its site. Keep it short: it must fit on one line. */
"Copyright © 2026 %@" = "Copyright © 2026 %@";

/* ===== Hiding pane ===== */

/* Hiding pane intro. */
"Makes Cmd+H work even when the app is the last one showing." = "Cmd+H fonctionne même quand l’app est la dernière affichée.";

/* Card title and picker label: what happens when only one app is visible on screen. */
"When only one app is showing" = "Quand une seule app est affichée";

/* App Store build only (shown in the store screenshots, so never say Mac or macOS). Explains how the last app gets hidden. */
"Cmd+H hides the last app completely. While one app or none is showing, CommandH's icon appears in the Dock. That's what lets the last app hide." = "Cmd+H masque complètement la dernière app. Tant qu’une seule app ou aucune n’est affichée, l’icône de CommandH apparaît dans le Dock. C’est ce qui permet de masquer la dernière app.";

/* Radio choice: hide the last app. Sentence case. */
"Hide the app" = "Masquer l’app";

/* Explanation under the Hide the app choice. */
"The app hides completely, like Cmd+H anywhere else. CommandH's icon appears in the Dock while one app or none is showing." = "L’app est entièrement masquée, comme avec Cmd+H partout ailleurs. L’icône de CommandH apparaît dans le Dock tant qu’une seule app ou aucune n’est affichée.";

/* Radio choice: use the system's Show Desktop. Show Desktop is the macOS feature name; use its official localized name. */
"Show Desktop" = "Afficher le bureau";

/* Explanation under the Show Desktop choice. */
"Windows slide to the edges of the screen, and Cmd+H again brings them back. CommandH never appears in the Dock." = "Les fenêtres glissent vers les bords de l’écran, et un nouveau Cmd+H les fait revenir. CommandH n’apparaît jamais dans le Dock.";

/* ===== System pane ===== */

/* Settings switch label. Sentence case. */
"Open at login" = "Ouvrir avec la session";

/* Settings switch label. Sentence case. */
"Show in menu bar" = "Afficher dans la barre des menus";

/* Shown under Show in menu bar while it is off. */
"To get back to these settings, open CommandH from your Applications folder." = "Pour revenir à ces réglages, ouvrez CommandH depuis votre dossier Applications.";

/* Card title above the Quit CommandH button. */
"Quit" = "Quitter";

/* Caption next to the Quit CommandH button. */
"Closing this window keeps CommandH running." = "Fermer cette fenêtre ne quitte pas CommandH.";

/* ===== Privacy pane ===== */

/* Privacy pane statement. */
"CommandH works entirely on your computer. It only looks at which apps are running and whether each one is hidden, and that never leaves your computer or gets stored. No account, no analytics, and no permissions to grant." = "CommandH fonctionne entièrement sur votre ordinateur. Il regarde seulement quelles apps sont ouvertes et si chacune est masquée, et ces informations ne quittent jamais votre ordinateur et ne sont jamais enregistrées. Aucun compte, aucune statistique d’utilisation, aucune autorisation à accorder.";

/* Card title in the Privacy pane. */
"Network activity" = "Activité réseau";

/* Network activity card text. */
"None. CommandH never connects to the internet on its own. The links in these settings open in your browser." = "Aucune. CommandH ne se connecte jamais à Internet de lui-même. Les liens de ces réglages s’ouvrent dans votre navigateur.";

/* Link that opens the privacy policy in the browser. */
"Read the full privacy policy" = "Lire la politique de confidentialité complète";

